# Build context for every Dockerfile in the repository (apps/*/Dockerfile and
# docker/*/Dockerfile all build from the root, because the workspace is one install).
# What is left out: dependencies and build output (installed and built inside the image),
# every environment file but the template, the tests and their output, tooling caches,
# the docs and screenshots, and the git history.
#
# One exception: `apps/purse/src/routes/docs.ts` bundles the contract fixtures into the
# public `/docs` page, so `apps/purse/test/contract/fixtures.json` must reach the build
# even though `**/test` does not. Without it `pnpm --filter @purse/api build` fails inside
# the image with "Could not resolve ../../test/contract/fixtures.json" while succeeding on
# a full checkout, which is how it reached a deploy (docs/decisions.md).
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test
!apps/purse/test/contract/fixtures.json
**/e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/.vitest
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
docs
docker/postgres
.lavish
.claude
.railway
.agents
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
